## 3. ASP.NET Core (C#/.NET)

### Mục tiêu

ASP.NET Core là một cross-platform, high-performance framework từ Microsoft cho việc xây dựng modern, cloud-enabled web applications. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, ASP.NET Core đóng vai trò là một trong những lựa chọn chính cho backend development, đặc biệt cho các dự án enterprise cần strong typing, performance cao, và deep integration với Microsoft ecosystem.

### Nguyên tắc

**1. Clean Architecture**

Separate into layers: Presentation, Application, Domain, Infrastructure. Dependencies point inward. Domain has no external dependencies. Clear boundaries between layers.

**2. Dependency Injection**

Use built-in DI container. Register services properly. Consider lifetimes (Singleton, Scoped, Transient). Avoid Service Locator pattern. Constructor injection preferred.

**3. Minimal APIs vs Controllers**

Use Minimal APIs for simple endpoints. Use Controllers for complex scenarios. Controllers provide more structure. Both can coexist in same project.

**4. CQRS Pattern**

Separate read và write operations. Use Commands for writes. Use Queries for reads. Different models for different purposes. Better optimization options.

**5. Entity Framework Core Best Practices**

Use navigation properties properly. Configure relationships in Fluent API. Use eager loading wisely (avoid N+1). Use AsNoTracking for read-only. Proper index configuration.

**6. Middleware Pipeline**

Use middleware for cross-cutting concerns. Keep middleware in order. Short-circuit when possible. Don't do heavy work in middleware. Use exception handling middleware.

**7. Configuration Management**

Use IOptions pattern. Environment-specific settings. User secrets for development. Azure Key Vault for production. Strongly typed configuration.

**8. API Versioning**

Version APIs from the start. Use URL path versioning. Maintain multiple versions. Deprecate gracefully. Document breaking changes.

**9. Health Checks**

Implement health checks. Check dependencies. Use for load balancer. Include in monitoring. Different health checks for different purposes.

**10. Performance Considerations**

Use async/await throughout. Configure response compression. Use caching appropriately. Configure connection pooling. Monitor memory usage.

