## 11. ChatbotX Pattern (Next.js + BullMQ + Drizzle)

### Tổng quan

ChatbotX là open-source ManyChat alternative. Tech stack:

- **Frontend:** Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript 5
- **Backend Workers:** BullMQ (Redis), Kafka
- **Database:** Drizzle ORM, PostgreSQL, pgvector
- **Realtime:** PartyKit / PartySocket
- **Monorepo:** Turborepo, pnpm workspaces

### Architecture Overview

```
apps/
├── builder/    → Next.js web app (pages, server actions, oRPC)
├── worker/     → Background workers (BullMQ, Kafka)
├── realtime/   → PartySocket realtime server
├── cli/        → CLI client
└── mcp-server/ → MCP server (stdio/SSE)

packages/
├── database/      → Drizzle ORM + schema
├── business/       → Business logic services
├── worker-config/  → Queue/job type definitions
└── ui/           → Shared UI components
```

### Service Layer Pattern

Business logic MUST live in `packages/business/src/<feature>/service.ts`:

```typescript
// packages/business/src/contacts/service.ts
export class ContactService extends BaseService {
  async create(params: CreateContactParams): Promise<Contact> {
    // Business logic here
  }
}

export const contactService = new ContactService()
```

**NEVER** put business logic in feature folders (`apps/builder/src/features/`).

### Feature Folder Pattern

Feature folders contain ONLY:
- `queries/` — RSC wrappers calling business services
- `actions/` — Server actions (next-safe-action)
- `schema/` — Zod validation schemas
- `api/` — oRPC route handlers
- `components/`, `hooks/`, `provider/` — UI concerns

### Action Clients

| Client | Use When |
|--------|----------|
| `workspaceActionClient` | Requires workspace membership |
| `authActionClient` | Requires authentication only |

### Queue Pattern (BullMQ)

```typescript
// packages/worker-config/src/queues/contact-import/index.ts
export enum ContactImportJobAction {
  importCsv = "importCsv",
  importJson = "importJson",
}

export type ContactImportJobData = {
  type: ContactImportJobAction
  data: { workspaceId: string; fileId: string }
}
```

**CRITICAL:** Job ID must NOT contain `:` (BullMQ Redis delimiter).

### Database Pattern (Drizzle)

```typescript
// Table with sharedColumns
export const contactModel = pgTable("Contact", {
  ...sharedColumns,
  phone: text(),
  workspaceId: bigintAsString().references(() => workspaceModel.id),
})

// Enum pattern
export const contactStatus = pgEnum("contactStatus", ["active", "blocked"])
```

### i18n Pattern

ALL user-facing strings MUST use `useTranslations()`:

```typescript
// WRONG
<Button>Save</Button>

// CORRECT
const t = useTranslations()
<Button>{t("actions.save")}</Button>
```

### Checklist: New ChatbotX Feature

- [ ] Create `src/features/<feature>/` directory
- [ ] Define Zod schemas in `schema/`
- [ ] Create queries in `queries/` (call business service)
- [ ] Add server actions in `actions/`
- [ ] Create oRPC API in `api/` (if API needed)
- [ ] Register router in `src/routers/index.ts`
- [ ] Create page under `src/app/space/[workspaceId]/...`
- [ ] Add i18n translations (reuse `fields.*`)
- [ ] Verify no hardcoded strings

